---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../site';
import { breadcrumb } from '../lib/schema';
---

<Base title="Press | Silent Thread" description="Press kit for Silent Thread: logos, colours, type and contact." schema={[breadcrumb([{ name: 'Press', path: '/press' }])]}>
  <section class="section press" aria-labelledby="press-title">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <p class="label">Press</p>
      <h1 id="press-title" class="h2">Press kit.</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>A full press kit is on the way. Until then, the logo files, colours, type and the short bios are in the studio's public brand repository.</p>
      <p>Silent Thread is a game studio and dev-tools Lab from Colombia, founded by Esteban Estrada.</p>
    </div>
    <p class="press-links">
      <a class="link" href="https://github.com/silentthreadstudio/brand" rel="noopener">Brand and logos <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      <a class="link" href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .press { padding-top: calc(var(--header-h) + 12vh); border-top: 0; min-height: 70svh; }
  .press-links { margin: 2rem 0 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.8rem 2rem; }
</style>
